    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 8212,
        "title": "Zuweisungsoperatoren",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 71876,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Da Selbstzuweisung ein leistungsstarkes Werkzeug zum Erstellen von Programmen ist, lass uns ein paar Operatoren kennenlernen, die uns helfen, Code schneller zu schreiben.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 71882,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wir wissen, dass wir <code>1</code> zu einer Variable hinzufügen können, indem wir den Namen der Variable ausschreiben. In diesem Fall <code>likes</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes = likes + \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"28\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>likes</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "+= operator",
            "id": 71877,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Statt den Namen der Variable neu zu schreiben, können wir den <code>+=</code>-Operator verwenden, um eine Zahl mit <code>likes += 1</code> zu addieren.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes</code>, gefolgt von <code>+=</code> und schließlich <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <code>+=</code>-Operator addiert eine Zahl, ohne den Variablennamen neu zu schreiben. Sorge dafür, dass die Konsole <code>6</code> ausgibt.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes += \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"5\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes</code>, gefolgt von <code>+=</code> und schließlich <code>1</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "-= operator",
            "id": 71878,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um den Wert einer Variable zu verringern, verwenden wir den <code>-=</code> Operator, wie hier, wo wir <code>likes</code> um <code>3</code> verringern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes -= \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>-=</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "++ operator",
            "id": 72161,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <strong>Inkrementoperator</strong>, <code>++</code>, der nach dem Namen einer Variablen platziert wird, erhöht ihren Wert um <code>1</code>. Hier wird <code>likes++</code> den Wert von <code>5</code> auf <code>6</code> erhöhen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <strong>Inkrementoperator</strong> <code>++</code> nach einem Variablennamen erhöht dessen Wert um <code>1</code>. Ändere <code>likes</code> von <code>5</code> auf <code>6</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"6\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "-- operator",
            "id": 72162,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der <strong>Dekrementoperator</strong> (<code>--</code>) zieht <code>1</code> vom Wert einer Variablen ab. Hier verringert <code>likes--</code> den Wert von <code>likes</code> von <code>5</code> auf <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"likes++\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes--</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Dekrement-Operator <code>--</code> subtrahiert <code>1</code>. Setze ihn hinter <code>likes</code>, um den Wert von <code>5</code> in <code>4</code> zu ändern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" likes = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"likes--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(likes);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>likes</code>, gefolgt von <code>-</code> und schließlich <code>-</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: += operator",
            "id": 72153,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(marbles);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>8</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Die erste Zeile weist <code>marbles</code> den Wert <code>6</code> zu. Was zeigt die Konsole nach der nächsten Zeile an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" marbles = \" /><text value=\"6\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"marbles += \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(marbles);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"8\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>8</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>6</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>2</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>8</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: -= operator",
            "id": 72154,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welchen Operator verwenden wir, um eine Zahl vom Wert einer Variable zu subtrahieren?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>-=</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mit welchem Operator ziehen wir eine Zahl vom Wert einer Variablen ab? Ändere <code>12</code> mithilfe von <code>3</code> zu <code>9</code>.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>-=</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>-=</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 72155,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Welcher Operator addiert eins zum Wert einer Variablen?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>++</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ein Zähler steht auf <code>7</code> und soll ohne die Zahl <code>8</code> auf <code>8</code> steigen. Welcher Operator schafft das in einem Schritt?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>--</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>+=</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>++</code> aus.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 72156,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Was zeigt dieser Code in der Konsole an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>199</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>201</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>199</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Du ersetzt <code>speed--;</code> durch <code>speed++;</code> und führst das Programm aus. Was zeigt die Konsole jetzt an?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" speed = \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"speed--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(speed);\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"199\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">201</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">199</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">200</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle 201 aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: += operator",
            "id": 72159,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Addiere zehn zum Wert der Variable mit dem <code>+=</code> Operator.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(yards);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>yards</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>=</code>, <code>10</code>, <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Operator <code>+=</code> addiert eine Zahl zum aktuellen Wert und speichert das Ergebnis in derselben Variable.</p><p>Erhöhe <code>yards</code> mit diesem Operator um <code>10</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" yards = \" /><text value=\"80\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"yards += \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(yards);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"22\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"28\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"++\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"80\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"90\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>yards</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code>, <code>=</code>, <code>10</code> und schließlich <code>;</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: -= operator",
            "id": 72160,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ziehe 200 vom Wert der Variable ab, indem du den <code>-=</code> Operator verwendest.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(account);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>-=</code>, gefolgt von <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Der Operator <code>-=</code> subtrahiert eine Zahl vom aktuellen Wert und speichert das Ergebnis in derselben Variable.</p><p>Ziehe mit diesem Operator eine Zahlung von <code>200</code> von <code>account</code> ab.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" account = \" /><text value=\"1000\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"account -= \" /><text value=\"200\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(account);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"28\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"+=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"--\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"1000\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"800\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>account</code>, gefolgt von <code>-=</code> und schließlich <code>200</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Incrementing numbers",
            "id": 71879,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erhöhe den Wert der <code>wallet</code>-Variable um eins.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"wallet + 2\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>wallet</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Erhöhe <code>wallet</code> um eins. Setze den Inkrement-Operator hinter den Variablennamen.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"24\" endIndex=\"25\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"13\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"14\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Wähle <code>wallet</code>, gefolgt von <code>+</code> und schließlich <code>+</code> aus.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Decrementing numbers",
            "id": 71880,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Verwende den Dekrement-Operator <code>--</code>, um das Wallet um eins zu verringern.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" wallet = \" /><text value=\"13\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"wallet--;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(wallet);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"25\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"12\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Gib <code>wallet--</code> ein.</p></body></html>"
